WEBVTT

00:31.010 --> 00:33.270
[You Have My Heart]

00:33.290 --> 00:36.120
[Episode 7
By Faces We Pledge]

00:43.950 --> 00:45.030
I, Wan,

00:46.700 --> 00:48.700
beg an audience with the Magistrate

00:49.900 --> 00:51.430
to seek justice.

00:52.720 --> 00:53.850
Aren't you dead?

01:02.980 --> 01:03.620
My Lord.

01:04.190 --> 01:05.190
Stay away from me!

01:06.000 --> 01:07.000
Stay away from me!

01:08.340 --> 01:08.980
My Lord,

01:10.780 --> 01:12.060
I am Wan.

01:21.340 --> 01:22.200
You are warm.

01:24.240 --> 01:25.200
You're alive.

01:29.070 --> 01:31.070
Then who's the one dead in that room?

01:51.380 --> 01:52.979
You like this face very much.

01:55.310 --> 01:56.240
Very beautiful,

01:56.590 --> 01:57.340
isn't it?

01:59.009 --> 02:00.340
It is indeed beautiful.

02:01.160 --> 02:03.770
As expected of a masterpiece
of your making.

02:04.920 --> 02:05.790
Not just mine.

02:06.400 --> 02:07.460
We did it together.

02:18.750 --> 02:21.060
You have been nourished
in the pool for a long time.

02:21.060 --> 02:22.920
Your mind has long since cleared.

02:23.430 --> 02:24.560
Playing dumb with me

02:26.560 --> 02:27.560
is pointless.

02:28.920 --> 02:31.290
I... I wouldn't dare.

02:32.020 --> 02:33.900
The corpse in Huichun Brothel

02:34.650 --> 02:35.640
is Mingyuan.

02:54.329 --> 02:55.430
It is Mingyuan.

02:57.329 --> 02:58.210
This scar,

02:58.840 --> 03:00.050
she got it one year

03:00.890 --> 03:03.490
when she accidentally
knocked over a brazier.

03:45.450 --> 03:47.640
We had everything prepared.

03:49.610 --> 03:51.520
Why did it end like this?

03:56.500 --> 03:57.160
Madam Chun.

03:57.850 --> 04:00.380
Since you're certain
the victim is Mingyuan,

04:00.520 --> 04:02.520
why did you misidentify her before?

04:02.790 --> 04:03.510
My Lord.

04:04.110 --> 04:06.050
The body was mutilated so horribly,

04:06.050 --> 04:08.100
I couldn't bear to look at it closely.

04:08.100 --> 04:09.220
I only saw

04:09.630 --> 04:11.360
she was wearing Wan's clothes,

04:11.410 --> 04:13.250
so I assumed it was Wan.

04:14.600 --> 04:15.250
Wan.

04:16.450 --> 04:17.829
Since you're not the victim,

04:17.829 --> 04:19.459
why haven't you come to the county yamen

04:19.459 --> 04:21.660
to clear this up for days after the case?

04:22.480 --> 04:23.360
My Lord.

04:24.800 --> 04:26.060
For the past five days,

04:27.670 --> 04:30.110
I've been staying in Lin County
with Mr. Du.

04:32.070 --> 04:32.800
Mr. Du?

04:34.070 --> 04:35.200
Mingyuan's patron?

04:36.360 --> 04:36.870
You two...

04:36.870 --> 04:37.720
No.

04:39.120 --> 04:40.920
It's not what you think, My Lord.

04:42.950 --> 04:44.600
I went with Mr. Du

04:46.760 --> 04:48.320
for Mingyuan's sake.

04:49.950 --> 04:51.680
The women of Yin-Yang Crossing

04:51.870 --> 04:54.800
have their own ways
of making themselves beautiful.

04:56.670 --> 04:59.600
Some ask the Dagger Spirit
to refine their features,

04:59.680 --> 05:03.080
while others let the Face-Weaving Spider
plump their looks.

05:03.450 --> 05:05.050
But Mingyuan was different.

05:06.630 --> 05:08.030
She was a natural beauty,

05:08.510 --> 05:10.470
and relied on her original face

05:10.660 --> 05:13.320
to become the top courtesan
of Huichun Brothel.

05:13.780 --> 05:17.110
She used to despise
those artificial cosmetic procedures.

05:17.390 --> 05:18.430
But this year,

05:20.850 --> 05:23.510
she also started sighing
in front of the mirror.

05:25.000 --> 05:26.630
About a month ago,

05:27.630 --> 05:29.290
I noticed that her appearance

05:29.340 --> 05:30.940
had quietly begun to change.

05:32.510 --> 05:33.510
At first,

05:34.450 --> 05:37.250
her eyes were just bigger
and brighter than usual.

05:38.510 --> 05:39.190
Later,

05:40.060 --> 05:42.659
her lips also became unusually full
and plump.

05:43.750 --> 05:44.480
I knew

05:45.200 --> 05:47.260
she eventually, like everyone else,

05:47.580 --> 05:48.530
found a way.

05:50.190 --> 05:52.120
This wouldn't have been a big deal.

05:52.350 --> 05:53.880
But even after the changes,

05:53.980 --> 05:56.310
she felt it wasn't enough
a few days later,

05:56.930 --> 05:58.460
and started sighing again.

05:59.180 --> 06:00.440
Constantly comparing herself

06:00.440 --> 06:02.440
to the younger girls in the brothel,

06:03.850 --> 06:05.210
She became obsessed.

06:12.160 --> 06:15.550
Mr. Du truly adores Mingyuan.

06:17.370 --> 06:19.570
He couldn't bear
to see her in such pain.

06:19.910 --> 06:20.910
So we agreed

06:22.640 --> 06:25.770
that he would go home
to sell his antiques and paintings,

06:26.740 --> 06:29.170
and I would lead the way
to my hometown in Lin County

06:29.170 --> 06:30.880
to buy a quiet courtyard.

06:31.710 --> 06:34.780
We wanted to take Mingyuan
away from Huichun Brothel,

06:35.310 --> 06:36.970
away from Yin-Yang Crossing.

06:37.909 --> 06:39.159
Everything has been arranged.

06:39.159 --> 06:41.490
This is ultimately a prison for her heart.

06:41.670 --> 06:42.800
Let's take her away.

06:46.470 --> 06:47.670
This is too precious.

06:47.900 --> 06:48.580
Mr. Du,

06:48.830 --> 06:49.590
just keep it.

06:51.120 --> 06:53.380
It is better that you give it to Mingyuan.

06:57.840 --> 07:00.440
It happened to be
Mingyuan's birthday soon,

07:01.300 --> 07:02.380
so we thought

07:02.640 --> 07:03.770
we'd keep it a secret

07:04.190 --> 07:05.520
as a birthday surprise.

07:06.140 --> 07:07.400
Who would have thought

07:07.600 --> 07:10.260
that there was a murder
right after we came back.

07:10.560 --> 07:12.000
I was the one dead.

07:13.990 --> 07:16.590
Mingyuan was suspected
of being the murderer,

07:18.830 --> 07:20.360
and also went missing.

07:28.180 --> 07:29.390
So Mingyuan

07:29.930 --> 07:32.810
also cares deeply about her looks.

07:39.510 --> 07:40.240
Shopkeeper.

07:41.510 --> 07:43.800
Has anyone come to your shop recently

07:43.909 --> 07:44.800
to buy arsenic?

07:46.680 --> 07:47.560
Arsenic.

07:48.950 --> 07:49.750
A few days ago,

07:49.780 --> 07:51.040
a woman came to my shop.

07:51.390 --> 07:53.150
She first asked for some wound ointment.

07:53.150 --> 07:54.460
Halfway through getting it,

07:54.460 --> 07:55.630
she suddenly changed her mind

07:55.630 --> 07:57.480
and said, "forget it,
give me some arsenic instead."

07:57.480 --> 07:58.360
Nothing else.

08:01.870 --> 08:02.750
Did this woman

08:03.240 --> 08:05.240
have any distinguishing features?

08:06.050 --> 08:07.650
She was young and wore a veil.

08:08.990 --> 08:09.590
Oh, right.

08:09.710 --> 08:11.100
Her voice and figure

08:11.440 --> 08:14.300
were somewhat like Mingyuan
from Huichun Brothel.

08:15.040 --> 08:15.870
I once had the honor

08:15.870 --> 08:18.330
of seeing Miss Mingyuan's graceful figure.

08:19.190 --> 08:21.050
Truly unforgettable at a glance.

08:21.480 --> 08:23.390
That's why I remember that woman

08:23.410 --> 08:24.470
a bit more clearly.

08:24.600 --> 08:25.600
Is that the point?

08:25.880 --> 08:27.280
Just sell your medicine!

08:27.300 --> 08:27.770
Okay.

08:29.160 --> 08:31.430
So Mingyuan herself bought the arsenic.

08:32.500 --> 08:34.700
Could it be that she committed suicide?

08:36.070 --> 08:38.669
The Mirror Spirit can take on
Mingyuan's form.

08:38.720 --> 08:39.750
Have you forgotten?

08:39.750 --> 08:40.549
That's right.

08:42.600 --> 08:45.460
Then it's really hard to say
who actually bought it.

08:46.080 --> 08:47.030
But why

08:47.720 --> 08:49.320
did she need wound ointment?

08:50.590 --> 08:51.790
Perhaps...

08:51.820 --> 08:53.700
Why switch to arsenic later?

09:00.030 --> 09:01.870
If I were Lord Bai right now,

09:02.820 --> 09:04.150
how would I deduce this?

09:10.500 --> 09:13.380
Wound ointment reduces swelling,
stops bleeding,

09:13.960 --> 09:16.160
regenerates tissue, and clears sores.

09:17.360 --> 09:18.520
What else can it do?

09:20.750 --> 09:21.790
All I know is

09:22.190 --> 09:24.190
that it cannot cure a brain illness.

09:24.430 --> 09:26.430
Stop posturing and wasting time.

09:26.640 --> 09:27.970
Just go back and report.

09:31.190 --> 09:32.640
Who's the one posturing?

09:39.080 --> 09:39.790
Beautiful.

09:51.020 --> 09:52.520
This is Face-Weaving Spider.

09:52.520 --> 09:56.180
He specializes in spinning silk
to plump up skin and lift the face.

09:56.590 --> 09:59.050
This is the new county magistrate,
Lord Bai.

10:02.610 --> 10:04.870
The Mirror Spirit used to work under you?

10:05.390 --> 10:06.150
My Lady,

10:06.610 --> 10:08.140
Jing was once my assistant.

10:08.560 --> 10:09.690
What happened then?

10:10.740 --> 10:11.800
Jing loves beauty.

10:12.160 --> 10:13.890
After meeting someone better,

10:14.300 --> 10:16.070
she naturally abandoned me.

10:17.360 --> 10:17.960
Thank you.

10:19.180 --> 10:20.180
I'll walk you out.

10:24.920 --> 10:25.520
Take care.

10:45.140 --> 10:46.940
I come for Face-Weaving Spider.

10:47.360 --> 10:48.200
I heard

10:48.520 --> 10:50.440
he can make people look younger.

10:55.680 --> 10:58.680
Miss,
the price of this skin-filling technique

10:59.480 --> 11:00.240
is too high.

11:01.240 --> 11:03.120
The more you refine, the weaker it gets.

11:03.120 --> 11:04.190
In a few months,

11:04.360 --> 11:06.160
you'll find your skin

11:06.750 --> 11:08.280
much older than it is today.

11:09.770 --> 11:12.170
I have heard those words.

11:13.760 --> 11:14.550
But I...

11:16.940 --> 11:18.610
What if there's a better way?

11:20.600 --> 11:23.240
Everyone has a love for beauty.

11:24.790 --> 11:26.520
But if it becomes an obsession,

11:27.350 --> 11:28.810
one will gradually forget

11:28.930 --> 11:30.880
what true beauty is.

11:32.780 --> 11:33.550
I never thought

11:33.550 --> 11:34.960
that the Mirror Spirit and Mingyuan

11:34.960 --> 11:36.760
would share such a deep history.

11:37.070 --> 11:37.620
It seems

11:38.080 --> 11:40.560
she is still our best breakthrough point
for this case.

11:40.560 --> 11:42.090
When investigating in Yin-Yang Crossing,

11:42.090 --> 11:44.370
you must consider things more deeply.

11:47.080 --> 11:49.210
Thank you for the advice, Lady Fufeng.

11:49.790 --> 11:50.850
Consider it a debt.

11:52.500 --> 11:53.930
When you owe me more...

11:57.270 --> 11:57.960
Then what?

12:03.670 --> 12:06.000
You'll stay here and pay them back slowly.

12:33.770 --> 12:36.170
Mingyuan has been taken by Wan and Mr. Du

12:36.390 --> 12:38.140
to her new residence for burial.

12:38.140 --> 12:39.140
Before they left,

12:39.650 --> 12:41.180
I restored her appearance.

12:43.860 --> 12:45.790
What happened to Mingyuan's face?

12:46.220 --> 12:47.080
Mirror Spirit,

12:47.760 --> 12:48.810
you still try to deny it

12:48.810 --> 12:49.850
at this point?

12:50.330 --> 12:52.050
You were jealous of Mingyuan's beauty,

12:52.050 --> 12:53.910
so you disfigured and killed her.

12:54.090 --> 12:54.950
Nonsense!

12:55.950 --> 12:57.950
I would rather die than hurt her.

12:59.590 --> 13:01.280
She was my only friend.

13:02.360 --> 13:03.150
Friend?

13:09.010 --> 13:10.740
We refined this face together.

13:11.680 --> 13:13.480
This is our shared masterpiece,

13:14.740 --> 13:16.620
and our shared secret.

13:40.150 --> 13:41.480
By blood we seal,

13:41.720 --> 13:43.000
mirrored as one heart.

13:43.480 --> 13:44.600
By faces we pledge,

13:44.790 --> 13:46.190
renewed year after year.

13:58.390 --> 14:00.390
I can become anyone I've seen.

14:01.570 --> 14:03.770
Now, look at your own face.

14:07.630 --> 14:08.630
You can tell me

14:08.900 --> 14:10.700
what you're not satisfied with.

14:11.200 --> 14:13.600
What good would it do to tell you?

14:33.360 --> 14:33.910
It

14:36.370 --> 14:37.300
really changed.

14:40.330 --> 14:41.590
How should I thank you?

14:43.470 --> 14:44.040
I...

14:45.630 --> 14:46.690
I don't want money.

14:49.200 --> 14:51.360
I only wish to borrow this face of yours

14:51.870 --> 14:53.000
to go out for a while.

14:54.850 --> 14:56.380
I want to feel what it's like

14:57.070 --> 14:58.870
to be looked at with admiration.

15:00.310 --> 15:02.570
Mingyuan was the first person
willing to light a lamp at night

15:02.570 --> 15:03.650
and wait for me.

15:04.450 --> 15:06.220
Her obsession grew deeper.

15:07.460 --> 15:10.290
She kept saying
she wanted to become more beautiful.

15:10.290 --> 15:12.290
But she was already very beautiful.

15:13.520 --> 15:16.760
If she changed further,
she would no longer be herself.

15:17.840 --> 15:18.770
She always said,

15:20.440 --> 15:21.870
''It does not matter if I lose myself.''

15:21.870 --> 15:23.800
It does not matter if I lose myself.

15:24.600 --> 15:26.400
As long as people still adore me,

15:27.450 --> 15:30.520
as long as no one leaves me.

15:33.630 --> 15:35.430
If the masterpiece is finished,

15:36.030 --> 15:37.790
she won't need you anymore.

15:38.380 --> 15:39.530
She will leave.

15:40.170 --> 15:42.600
She will go after the one she loves.

15:43.340 --> 15:44.340
By then,

15:44.800 --> 15:47.130
you won't be able to become her anymore.

15:47.630 --> 15:48.540
Right?

15:48.790 --> 15:49.520
No.

15:50.250 --> 15:51.560
She won't leave me.

15:51.700 --> 15:53.030
You're too naive.

15:53.780 --> 15:57.510
Find a way to make her stay.

15:58.140 --> 16:01.930
Find a way to make her stay.

16:02.210 --> 16:02.850
Jing,

16:03.200 --> 16:04.460
what's wrong with you?

16:10.710 --> 16:12.240
You're scaring me a little.

16:17.760 --> 16:19.000
I don't remember.

16:19.320 --> 16:20.390
I don't remember.

16:23.380 --> 16:23.910
My Lady.

16:23.910 --> 16:25.110
My head hurts so much.

16:31.330 --> 16:32.750
My Lady, your...

16:52.780 --> 16:54.580
I don't remember what happened.

16:56.670 --> 16:58.550
I looked at the face in the mirror

16:59.320 --> 17:01.250
and just thought it was beautiful.

17:01.720 --> 17:03.850
But I didn't even recognize who it was.

17:04.550 --> 17:07.410
I've been staying at Xiqianhua
these past few days.

17:07.589 --> 17:11.030
Lady Fufeng restored my consciousness
with the spiritual spring.

17:11.030 --> 17:12.290
Then I remembered her.

17:14.050 --> 17:15.970
I thought Mingyuan had run away.

17:16.440 --> 17:17.890
I didn't want you to catch her,

17:17.890 --> 17:18.609
so

17:19.589 --> 17:21.450
I pretended to remember nothing.

17:23.240 --> 17:24.050
So...

17:25.369 --> 17:26.569
So her face...

17:28.250 --> 17:29.100
It was me.

18:10.470 --> 18:11.190
It was me.

18:12.640 --> 18:13.840
It was the evil power.

18:14.340 --> 18:17.140
Because your mind was corrupted
by the evil power,

18:17.160 --> 18:19.880
you accidentally disfigured Mingyuan.

18:20.740 --> 18:22.350
I killed her.

18:24.960 --> 18:27.510
Her pupils were dilated,
the root of her tongue turned black,

18:27.510 --> 18:28.770
and her blood was dark.

18:29.090 --> 18:30.750
These are signs of poisoning.

18:31.450 --> 18:32.710
She must have applied wound ointment

18:32.710 --> 18:33.910
after being injured.

18:34.990 --> 18:37.030
But a few days later,
when she looked in the mirror

18:37.030 --> 18:38.590
and saw her ruined face,

18:39.240 --> 18:40.370
her mind shattered.

18:40.750 --> 18:42.600
She took poison and ended her own life.

18:42.600 --> 18:43.930
As for her other wounds,

18:44.290 --> 18:45.650
she inflicted them on herself

18:45.650 --> 18:47.680
with the mirror, cut by cut.

19:05.970 --> 19:06.690
As for

19:07.420 --> 19:09.350
why she was wearing Wan's clothes,

19:09.510 --> 19:11.510
it's because she didn't want anyone

19:11.950 --> 19:13.480
to recognize her as the once

19:13.950 --> 19:15.750
famed courtesan of the region--

19:16.320 --> 19:17.040
Mingyuan.

19:46.030 --> 19:46.490
My Lady,

19:47.010 --> 19:48.940
I have something to ask you.

19:49.750 --> 19:50.270
Speak.

19:51.040 --> 19:54.110
The Mirror Spirit masters the art
of altering appearances.

19:54.110 --> 19:55.450
Why did she only decide to change faces

19:55.450 --> 19:56.850
after meeting Mingyuan?

20:00.230 --> 20:02.360
Because she thought she was unworthy.

20:02.960 --> 20:05.000
Even if she could easily
change her appearance,

20:05.000 --> 20:07.660
she had to repeatedly
find reasons for herself.

20:08.440 --> 20:09.570
Just like Mingyuan,

20:10.830 --> 20:13.400
clearly a famous beauty
in Yin-Yang Crossing,

20:13.400 --> 20:15.400
yet because she was slightly older,

20:15.640 --> 20:17.900
she changed her appearance at all costs.

20:19.390 --> 20:21.270
They both have extraordinary qualities,

20:21.270 --> 20:23.870
yet are consumed
by the dread of fading beauty.

20:24.920 --> 20:26.040
This human and this spirit,

20:26.040 --> 20:27.950
could share the exact same agony.

20:31.920 --> 20:32.480
My Lady,

20:32.870 --> 20:34.190
once this case is over,

20:34.620 --> 20:37.280
how will Xiqianhua deal
with the Mirror Spirit?

20:38.160 --> 20:39.640
She will be punished according to the law.

20:39.640 --> 20:42.180
After the punishment,
she will stay in Xiqianhua

20:42.180 --> 20:43.100
to work for me.

20:44.080 --> 20:44.990
Work for you?

20:47.350 --> 20:47.790
Yes.

20:48.750 --> 20:49.310
For me.

20:52.980 --> 20:53.700
What?

20:55.630 --> 20:56.830
Do you want to as well?

21:01.060 --> 21:02.900
My Lady, who exactly wants that?

21:20.690 --> 21:21.540
I don't.

21:24.960 --> 21:26.310
This case is closed,

21:26.510 --> 21:29.350
but evil power lies behind all of this.

21:30.930 --> 21:32.130
Keep investigating.

21:35.090 --> 21:35.680
Yes.

21:36.370 --> 21:37.570
Come see me tomorrow,

21:38.030 --> 21:38.880
late at night.

21:44.550 --> 21:45.160
My Lady,

21:46.480 --> 21:47.790
then I won't bother you further.
